<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 6.92 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 6.92 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.92 percent on Wednesday from 6.70 percent on Tuesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded in four reported transactions worth 4.8 million dinars ($6.8 million) in deals concluded in a narrow 6.5- to 7.0-percent range.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
